DESCRIPTION:Block Leader Idea Swap All Block Leaders and Co-Leaders are in
 vited to join us for refreshments and inspiration as we share ideas and th
 e lessons learned along the way. Whether you've finished the program or ha
 ve not started yet\, this is a chance to enjoy connecting with fellow team
  leaders. Even if you haven't walked your block&nbsp\;or hosted your first
  meeting\, we'd love to see you there! You can swap ideas for neighborhood
  meetings\, discuss what worked (and what didn't)\, brainstorm solutions t
 o common roadblocks\, and celebrate successes. This is a fun&nbsp\;space t
 o ask questions\, gain inspiration\, and build relationships with fellow t
 eam leaders. Please RSVP so we know how many people to plan for\, and brin
 g your co-leaders! #block-d23153a7ca83d8cacfe8 { --stroke-style: none\;--s
