 ransform)\; transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y)\; } Confessi
 ons of a Recovering Engineer: Transportation for a Strong Town In Confessi
 ons of a Recovering Engineer: Transportation for a Strong Town\, renowned 
 speaker and author of Strong Towns Charles L. Marohn Jr. delivers an acces
 sible and engaging exploration of America's transportation system\, laying
  bare the reasons why it no longer works as it once did\, and how to moder
 nize transportation to better serve local communities. You'll discover rea
 l-world examples of poor design choices and how those choices have dramati
 c and tragic effects on the lives of the people who use them. You'll also 
 find case studies and examples of design improvements that have revitalize
 d communities and improved safety. #block-f1e6baa8db82f92cb47e { --stroke-
